  <para style="h">Petro 1</para>
  <para style="toc1">Petro 1</para>
  <para style="toc2">Petro 1</para>
  <para style="toc3">Pet1</para>
  <para style="mt1">Petro 1</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Petro nɛ ji Yesu Kristo Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛlɔ ɔ, ngma womi nɛ ɔ ya ha Yuda bi Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ nɛ a fie kɛ je Yerusalem, nɛ a gbɛ fia Ponto, Galata, Kapadokia, Asia kɛ Bitinia a.<verse eid="1PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Mamimɛ, Tsɛ Mawu ɔ hla nyɛ kɛ je blema lokoo, nɛ e le kaa nyɛ ma plɛ e bimɛ. Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ngɛ ni tsue ngɛ nyɛ mi, nɛ e kɛ Yesu Kristo muɔ ɔ tsukɔ nyɛ he konɛ nyɛɛ sa e hɛ mi. Mawu dloomi kɛ he jɔmi nɛ ba nyɛ nɔ babauu.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wa he nɔ kami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />A je Mawu yi, wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo Tsɛ ɔ, lɛ nɔ nɛ fɔ wɔ ehe ngɛ e mɔbɔ nami babauu ɔ nya a. E ngɔ wɔ kɛ wo lɛ nitsɛ e weku ɔ mi, konɛ wa na he nɔ kami kɛ ha neneene wami ngɛ Yesu Kristo si nɛ e te kɛ je gbeje ɔ he. <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />Mawu to neneene wami nɛ ji nɔ́ke nɔ nɛ he tsɔ, nɛ puɛ we, nɛ tsakee we hulɔ ɔ kɛ ha e bi ɔmɛ ngɛ hiɔwe. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Nɛ ngɛ Mawu he wami ɔ nya a, nyɛ maa su lejɛ ɔ kɛ manye konɛ nyɛ nine nɛ su nɔ ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi ɔ nya. E maa pee nyɛ nɔ ngɛ nyagbe ligbi ɔ nɔ, nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ maa na. <verse eid="1PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Lɔ ɔ he ɔ, nyɛ na tsui, ejakaa bua jɔmi agbo ko ngɛ ha nyɛ hwɔɔ se; tse be ɔ, nyɛ ngɛ nɔ nae ngɛ hiɛ ɔ amlɔ nɛ ɔ.<verse eid="1PE 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />A ngɛ nyɛ kae nɛ a hyɛ ha kaa nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi ɔ mi wa nɛ e he tsɔ lo. Ejakaa sika tsu tete ɔ, a kɛ woɔ la mi nɛ a tsuɔ he. Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, e sa nɛ a ka nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ he jua wa pe sika tsu ɔ, konɛ e hi kɛ pi si. Ja a pee enɛ ɔ loko nyɛ nine maa su yi jemi kɛ anunyami kɛ bumi nɔ ngɛ Yesu Kristo bami ligbi ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="1PE 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Nyɛ suɔ lɛ, tse be ɔ, nyɛ nɛ lɛ hyɛ. E ngɛ mi kaa nyɛ nɛ lɛ hyɛ mohu se nyɛ he e nɔ ye, nɛ nyɛ na bua jɔmi babauu nɛ a be nyɛe maa kale. <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />Nɛ nyɛ nine maa su nyɛ klaa amɛ a yi wami hemi ɔ nɔ, ejakaa nyɛ he e nɔ ye.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Gbali ɔmɛ ngma kikɛmɛ a yi wami hemi nɛ ɔ he womi mohu, se a nui sisi bɔ nɛ sa, nɛ a bi nɛ a le nɔ nɛ e ji. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />A nui nɔ nɛ Kristo Mumi ɔ nɛ ngɛ a mi ɔ ngɛ tsɔɔe ɔ sisi, ejakaa e de mɛ nɛ a ngma níhi nɛ ba Kristo nɔ ɔ, e amanehlu kɛ anunyami agbo nɛ e na ngɛ se ɔ. Nɛ a hla nɛ a le be, kɛ nɔ nɛ nɔ nɛ ní nɛ ɔmɛ tsuo maa ba.<verse eid="1PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Nyagbe ɔ, a de mɛ ke ni nɛ ɔmɛ be bae ngɛ a hɛ nɔ, se mohu hwɔɔ se lokoo ngɛ a se. Jehanɛ ɔ a fiɛ Manye Munyu nɛ ɔ paa ngɔ tsɔɔ wɔ tsuo. Nɛ a fiɛ ngɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ a tsɔ kɛ je hiɔwe, nɛ tu munyu kɛ tsɔɔ mɛ ɔ he wami nya. E ngɛ nyakpɛ saminya kaa hiɔwe bɔfohi tete hlaa kaa a maa le e he sane. <verse eid="1PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ dla nyɛ he ngɛ nyɛ susumihi a mi nɛ nyɛɛ pee kpoo. Nyɛɛ ngɔ nyɛ hɛ kɛ fɔ Mawu dloomi nɛ nyɛ ma na ngɛ Yesu Kristo bami be ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="1PE 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Nyɛɛ bu Mawu tue, ejakaa e bimɛ ji nyɛ. Nyɛ ko di nyɛ sa akɔnɔ ni ɔmɛ a se, kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ ba nyɛ je mi be mi nɛ nyɛ li Mawu ɔ. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Kaa bɔ nɛ nɔ nɛ tsɛ nyɛ ɔ ngɛ klɔuklɔu ɔ, nyɛ hu nyɛɛ pee nyɛ he klɔuklɔu ngɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ mi. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />Ngmami ɔ de ke, “Nyɛɛ pee nyɛ he klɔuklɔu, ejakaa i ngɛ klɔuklɔu.”<verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Akɛnɛ Hiɔwe Tsɛ ɔ nɛ nyɛ sɔleɔ kɛ tsɛɔ ɔ hyɛ we nɔ hɛ mi ngɛ kojomi mi, se mohu e kojoɔ nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ e ni tsumi nya he je ɔ, nyɛɛ ba nyɛ je mi saminya.<verse eid="1PE 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A wo nyɛ yi hiɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Nyɛ le klɛdɛɛ kaa tsa pi níhi kaa sika hiɔ loo sika tsu nɛ puɛɔ ɔ nɛ Mawu kɛ kpɔ nyɛ kɛ je nyɛ tsɛmɛ a yakayaka je mi bami nɛ nyɛ kase ɔ mi. <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />Se mohu e kpɔ nyɛ kɛ Kristo muɔ nɛ he jua wa kaa to bi nɛ kpa ko be e he ɔ. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />A hla lɛ kɛ ha ni tsumi nɛ ɔ loko a bɔ je ɔ, se be nɛ ɔ mi loko ji a je lɛ kpo ngɛ nyɛ he.<verse eid="1PE 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />E nɔ nɛ nyɛ gu kɛ he Mawu, nɔ nɛ tle lɛ si kɛ je gbeje, nɛ e wo e hɛ mi nyami ɔ nɔ nɛ nyɛ ye. Nyɛ pee enɛ ɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi, kɛ nyɛ hɛ nɔ kami nɛ hi Mawu ɔ pɛ nɔ. <verse eid="1PE 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Jehanɛ ɔ, akɛnɛ nyɛ tsukɔ nyɛ klaa amɛ a he ngɛ anɔkuale ɔ tue bumi mi konɛ nyɛ na nyɛmimɛ a suɔmi he je ɔ, nyɛɛ kɛ tsui mi jɔmi nɛ suɔ nyɛ he.<verse eid="1PE 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Ejakaa a fɔ nyɛ ehe, pi nyɛ tsɛmɛ a mi nɛ e je, se mohu wami nɛ puɛ we ɔ mi a je kɛ fɔ nyɛ. Kikɛmɛ a wami he nɛ ɔ ji Mawu wami Munyu ɔ, nɛ e ngɛ daa. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ Ngmami ɔ de ɔ, “Adesahi kulaa ngɛ kaa nga, nɛ a hɛ mi nyami ɔ ngɛ kaa mɔmɔ. Nga gbliɔ, nɛ mɔmɔ kplɔɔ. <verse eid="1PE 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />Se Nutsɔ ɔ munyu ɔ ngɛ daa.” Enɛ ɔ ji Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ a fiɛ ngɔ tsɔɔ nyɛ ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Mawu nitsɛ nimli ji nyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ je ninyɛ kɛ je nyɛ mi kulaa, nɛ nyɛ kpa osato peemi, lakpa yemi, hunga jemi kɛ nihi a he munyu tumi. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Nyɛ ha nɛ Mawu munyu ɔ he kuma nɛ ye nyɛ nɛ nyɛɛ di se kaa bɔ nɛ bimwɔwi hlaa nyɔ nyu ɔ. Ejakaa lɔ ɔ ma ha nɛ nyɛ maa wa kɛ ha yi wami hemi. <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />Ejakaa nyɛ na bɔ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi mi jɔmi ɔ ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1PE 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Nyɛɛ ba Kristo ngɔ, e nɔ nɛ Mawu fia Asafo ɔ ngɔ ma kaa tɛ nɛ he wa. Nimli kua lɛ mohu, se e he jua wa ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi nɛ e hla lɛ.<verse eid="1PE 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Nyɛ hu nyɛɛ ba Mawu ngɔ nɛ e ngɔ nyɛ kɛ bɔ e asafo ɔ, kaa bɔ nɛ tsu malɔ woɔ tɛhi nɛ he wa kɛ maa tsu ɔ. Nɛ nyɛ sɔmɔ kaa osɔfo klɔuklɔuhi, nɛ nyɛɛ sa mumi mi bɔ nɛ maa sa Mawu hɛ mi kɛ gu Yesu Kristo nɔ. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Ejakaa Ngmami ɔ de ke, “O nɛ, i ngɛ Kristo tsɔe kaa ye asafo ɔ sisi kla; a je blɔ hla lɛ nɛ e he jua wa, nɛ zo be nihi nɛ heɔ e nɔ yeɔ gbee kɔkɔɔkɔ.”<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Ee, e he jua wa saminya kɛ ha nyɛ nihi nɛ nyɛ heɔ e nɔ yeɔ ɔ, se ni nɛmɛ nɛ kua lɛ ɔ, e ngɛ kaa “Tɛ nɛ tsu fiali ɔmɛ kua a, nɛ lɔ ɔ nɔuu ba plɛ kɔ nya tɛ kɛ ha mɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="1PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />Ngmami ɔ de ngɛ he kpa ko hu ke, “Lɛ ji tɛ nɛ ni konɛ ma tɛ, kɛ tɛ sa nɛ ma ha nɛ a maa nɔɔ si.” A ma tɛ si, ejakaa a bui Mawu Munyu ɔ tue, enɛ ɔ ji tue gblami nɛ a to kɛ ha mɛ.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Se nyɛɛ lɛɛ e slo nyɛ, ejakaa Mawu nɛ ji matsɛ ɔ nitsɛ nɛ hla nyɛ kaa osɔfohi kɛ e bimɛ, nɛ e pee nyɛ klɔuklɔu konɛ nyɛɛ ye odase kɛ tsɔɔ ni kpahi bɔ nɛ e tsɛ nyɛ kɛ je diblii mi kɛ ba e nyakpɛ la a he mi ɔ. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Be mi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ diblii ɔ mi ɔ, nyɛ pi nɔ ko kulaa, se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, nyɛ plɛ Mawu bimɛ. Kekle ɔ, a nɛ nyɛ mɔbɔ, se jehanɛ ɔ, a na nyɛ mɔbɔ.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Anyɛmimɛ, nibwɔhi kɛ blɔ hiali ji wɔ ngɛ hiɛ ɔ. Akɛnɛ hiɔwe ji wa we he je ɔ, i ngɛ nyɛ pɛɛ kpae kaa nyɛ ko di je nɛ ɔ mi akɔnɔ níhi a se, ejakaa a kɛ wɔ hwuu ta ngɛ mumi mi.<verse eid="1PE 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Nyɛɛ hyɛ nyɛ he saminya ngɛ nihi nɛ a he we a yi wami ɔmɛ a he. Ejakaa ke a tu munyu kɛ gbe nyɛ he guɛ tete po ɔ, a maa wo Mawu hɛ mi nyami ngɛ nyɛ ni tsumi kpakpa amɛ a he ngɛ Kristo bami ligbi ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="1PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ he ɔ, nyɛɛ ba nyɛ he si kɛ ha ma nɔ yeli ɔmɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />E to amlaalo ɔ nɛ e gbla yayami peeli a tue, nɛ a wo kpakpa peeli a hɛ mi nyami.<verse eid="1PE 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Ejakaa Mawu suɔmi nya ji kaa nyɛ kpakpa peemi ma ha nɛ kuasiahi ma kpa nyɛ he munyu yaya tumi . <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Nyɛɛ hi si kaa nihi nɛ ye a he; pi nihi nɛ ye a he kɛ ha yayami peemi, se kaa Mawu sɔmɔli.<verse eid="1PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Nyɛɛ bu nɔ tsuaa nɔ; nɛ nyɛɛ suɔ Kristo se nyɛɛli nɛ ngɛ he fɛɛ he. Nyɛɛ ye Mawu gbeye, nɛ nyɛɛ bu nɔ yeli ɔmɛ tue.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Mawanyumuhi kɛ mawayihi, nyɛɛ ba nyɛ he si kɛ ha nyɛ nutsɔ ɔmɛ nɛ nyɛɛ ye a gbi nɔ, pi nihi nɛ a mi mi jɔ nɛ a peeɔ nyɛ kpakpa kɛkɛ, se mohu ni nɛmɛ nɛ a yi mi wa ngɛ nyɛ nɔ ɔ hulɔ. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Ke nyɛ ngɔ nyɛ hɛ kɛ fɔ Mawu nɔ nɛ nyɛ pee we yayami ko se nyɛ ngɛ nɔ́ nae ɔ, nyɛ bua nɛ jɔ nyɛ he. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Ejakaa ke nyɛ pee yayami nɛ a gbla nyɛ tue ngɛ he nɛ nyɛ to nyɛ tsui si ɔ, mɛni hiɔwo nɛ nyɛ ma na ngɛ mi? Se ke kpakpa peemi he je nɛ nyɛ na amanehlu ngɛ nɛ nyɛ to nyɛ tsui si ɔ, lɛɛ e sa Mawu hɛ mi.<verse eid="1PE 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ Mawu tsɛ nyɛ ngɛ, ejakaa Kristo nitsɛ na amanehlu kɛ to nyɛ okadi konɛ nyɛɛ nyɛɛ e se. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />E pee we yayami ko nɛ e yi lakpa hulɔ. <verse eid="1PE 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Benɛ a jɛ lɛ ɔ, e jɛ we nɔ ko kɛ tui nane mi. E na amanehlu se e de we nɔ́ ko. E to e sane ɔ ngɔ wo Mawu, nɔ nɛ kojoɔ ngɛ dami nya a dɛ mi. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Lɛ nɛ e tloo wa he yayami ɔmɛ kɛ a he tue gblami ɔmɛ kɛ ho sɛumi tso ɔ nɔ ya, konɛ wa kpa yayami peemi nɛ waa pee kpakpa. Kɛ gu e nɔ nami ngɛ sɛumi tso ɔ nɔ nɛ a tsa nyɛ ngɛ nɔmlɔ tso kɛ mumi blɔ fa mi. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Ejakaa jinɛ nyɛ ngɛ kaa tohi nɛ laa blɔ, se amlɔ nɛ ɔ a kpale nyɛ kɛ ba nyɛ nɔ hyɛlɔ kɛ yi baalɔ ɔ ngɔ.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yigbayihi kɛ a hunohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Nɛ nyɛ yigbayi ɔmɛ hu, nyɛɛ ba nyɛ he si kɛ ha nyɛ huno ɔmɛ konɛ ke a ti ni komɛ he we Nutsɔ ɔ munyu ɔ yi tete po ɔ, nyɛ je mi bami nɛ tsake mɛ nɛ a he nɛ a ye. <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />Ejakaa nyɛ je mi bami kpakpa a ma tsake mɛ pe munyu tumi.<verse eid="1PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Nyɛ ko ngɔ yi hɔɔmi, he dlami kɛ sika tsu níhi, bo kɛ tade nguahi a womi kɛ pee nyɛ kɔmɔ. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Se mohu nyɛ ha nɛ a na nyɛ he fɛu ɔ ngɛ nyɛ tsui kɛ mumi nɛ hejɔ nɛ ngɛ daa, nɛ he jua wa ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi ɔ mi. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Kikɛmɛ a mumi mi he dlami nɛ ɔ nɛ blema yi klɔuklɔu ɔmɛ nɛ ngɔ a hɛ kɛ fɔ Mawu nɔ ɔ kɛ dla a he kɛ hi si kɛ ha a hunohi.<verse eid="1PE 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />Sara, Abraham yo ɔ hu bu e huno ɔ tue nɛ e tsɛ lɛ e nutsɔ. Ke nyɛ hu nyɛ pee ja a, kaa biyihi kpakpahi nɛ peeɔ nɔ́ nɛ da a, lɛɛ e hia we kaa nyɛɛ ye gbeye.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Nyɛ nyumu ɔmɛ, ja a nɔuu nyɛɛ kɛ nyɛ yi ɔmɛ nɛ hi si saminya, nɛ nyɛɛ le kaa a he wɛ tsɔ. Nyɛɛ bu mɛ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a ko tsi nyɛ sɔlemi kɛ pɛɛ kpami ɔmɛ blɔ, ejakaa Mawu dloo nyɛɛ kɛ mɛ tsuo neneene wami kake.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Nyagbe ɔ, nyɛ tsuo nyɛɛ hɛɛ juɛmi kake, nyɛɛ nu nyɛ bi a sisi, nyɛɛ suɔ nyɛ he kaa nyɛmimɛ, nyɛ mi mi nɛ jɔ ha nyɛ bi, nɛ nyɛɛ ba nyɛ he si. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Nyɛɛ kɛ yayami nɛ ko to yayami nane mi, aloo jɛmi ngɛ jɛmi nane mi; se mohu nyɛɛ gbaa mɛ, ejakaa enɛ ɔ he nɛ a tsɛ wɔ ngɛ, konɛ wa nine nɛ su Mawu jɔɔmi ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="1PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Nɔ nɛ ngɛ hlae nɛ e na bua jɔmi nɛ e se nɛ kɛ ngɛ je mi ɔ, e kɔ e lilɛ mi, nɛ e ko ye lakpa. <verse eid="1PE 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />E je e he kɛ je yayami he nɛ e pee kpakpa. E hla tue mi jɔmi nɛ e pɛtɛ he. <verse eid="1PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Ejakaa Nutsɔ ɔ hɛ ngɛ e bimɛ a he nɛ e buɔ a sɔlemi tue, se e kɛ yayami peeli yi.<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Nɔ ko pee we kpakpa peelɔ yayami. <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Se ke kpakpa peemi he je nɛ nyɛ ngɛ amanehlu nae ɔ, lɛɛ Mawu maa gbaa nyɛ. Nyɛ ko ye nimli gbeye, nɛ nyɛ ko hao hulɔ. <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Nyɛɛ ngɔ nyɛ hɛ kɛ fɔ Kristo nɔ nɛ nyɛɛ bu lɛ kaa nyɛ Nutsɔ. Nyɛ dla nyɛ he kɛ to be fɛɛ be konɛ ke nɔ ko bi nyɛ hɛ nɔ kami nɛ nyɛ ngɛ ɔ he sane ɔ, nyɛ nyɛ lɛ heto nɛ nyɛ ha; se nyɛɛ pee enɛ ɔ ngɛ kpoo peemi kɛ bumi mi.<verse eid="1PE 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />Nyɛɛ pee nɔ́ nɛ da, konɛ ke a tu munyu ke si nyɛ, nɛ a tsɛ nyɛ biɛ yaya a, zo nɛ gbe mɛ nitsɛmɛ kaa kpakpa peemi he je nɛ a gbe nyɛ he guɛ ngɛ. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Ke e ji Mawu suɔmi nya kaa nyɛɛ na amanehlu ɔ, nyɛɛ na amanehlu ngɛ kpakpa peemi he je, pi ngɛ yayami peemi he.<verse eid="1PE 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amanehlu nami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Ejakaa Kristo nitsɛ hu na amanehlu si kake pɛ ngɛ wa yayami ɔmɛ a he. Lɛ nɛ ji dalɔ ɔ, e gbo ngɛ nimli yayami peeli a nane mi konɛ e ngɔ wɔ kɛ ba Mawu ngɔ kɛ manye. A gbe lɛ ngɛ nɔmlɔ tso blɔ fa mi mohu, se e ngɛ wami mi ngɛ mumi blɔ fa mi. <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />Nɛ e gu mumi ɔ nɔuu mi kɛ ya slaa mumihi nɛ a wo mɛ tsu mi ɔ, nɛ e fiɛ kɛ tsɔɔ mɛ. <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />Nimli nɛ ɔmɛ ji nihi nɛ a bui Mawu tue be mi nɛ Noa ngɛ lɛ ngua a kpɛe ɔ, nɛ a kpata a hɛ mi ngɛ nyu jeje ɔ mi, nɛ a he nimli kpaanyɔ pɛ a yi wami kɛ je nyu ɔ mi. <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Nyu nɛ ɔ ji baptisimi nɛ a kɛ he nyɛ yi wami. Baptisimi pi nɔmlɔ tso he mu fɔmi, se he nile kpakpa somi nɛ a kɛ Mawu so kɛ gu Yesu Kristo si temi ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, Kristo ho hiɔwe ya nɛ e hii si ngɛ Mawu hiɔ nɔ, nɛ a ngɔ hiɔwe bɔfohi kɛ he blɔhi kɛ he wamihi tsuo ngɔ wo e sisi.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Akɛnɛ Kristo na amanehlu ngɛ he lo mi he je ɔ, nyɛ hu nyɛɛ le kaa nyɛ maa na amanehlu; nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ naa amanehlu ngɛ he lo blɔ fa mi ɔ, e kɛ yayami po tako mi. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Nɛ e di je nɛ ɔ mi akɔnɔ níhi a se hu, se mohu, e baa e je mi ngɛ Mawu suɔmi nya. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Nyɛ pee níhi fuu nɛ wɔ jali peeɔ ngɛ be nɛ be ɔ mi, kaa ajuama bɔmi, akɔnɔ níhi a se dimi, da demi kɛ fiɛmi sakasakahi.<verse eid="1PE 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Jehanɛ ɔ, e peeɔ wɔ jali ɔmɛ nyakpɛ kaa nyɛɛ kɛ mɛ kpa jamɛ a sakasaka je mi bami ɔ nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a jɛɔ nyɛ. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Se mohu a maa bu akɔtaa kɛ ha Mawu, nɔ nɛ maa kojo hɛ kali kɛ ni gbogboehi tsuo ɔ. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ a fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ ngɔ tsɔɔ ni gbogboehi tete po, nihi nɛ a kojo mɛ momo nɛ a gbla a tue be mi nɛ a ngɛ je mi ɔ, se a fiɛ kɛ ha mɛ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a he a klaa amɛ a yi wami.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Suɔmi haa yayamihi fuu a na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Je ɔ nyagbe ɔ su ta, lɔ ɔ he ɔ, nyɛ hɛ nɛ ka si nɛ nyɛɛ hɛɛ sɔlemi kɛ pɛɛ kpami mi. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Titli ɔ, nyɛɛ suɔ nyɛ he saminya, ejakaa suɔmi haa yayamihi fuu a nɔ. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Nyɛɛ pee nyɛ si bi nubwɔ kɛ nyɛ tsui kulaa .<verse eid="1PE 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Nɛ nyɛɛ ngɔ dloomi ni kpakpahi nɛ Mawu kɛ dloo nyɛ ɔ kɛ ye kɛ bua nyɛ si bi kaa sɔmɔli kpakpahi. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Nɔ nɛ fiɛɛ ɔ, e fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ kɛ hɛ dɔ kɛ he wami kaa munyu nɛ je Mawu ngɔ. Ke nɔ ko ngɛ e nyɛmi wae ɔ, e pee kɛ e tsui kulaa ngɛ he wami bɔ nɛ Mawu kɛ ha lɛ ɔ nya. Konɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ mi ɔ, a gu Yesu Kristo nɔ kɛ wo Mawu hɛ mi nyami. E nɔ ji anunyami ɔ kɛ he wami ɔ kɛ yaa neneene. Amen.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Anyɛmimɛ nɛ a suɔ,nyɛ nya nɛ ko kpɛ nyɛ he ngɛ amanehluhi nɛ ngɛ nyɛ nɔ bae ɔ he. A ji kahi nɛ a kɛ ngɛ nyɛ kae nɛ a kɛ tsu nyɛ he. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Se mohu nyɛ bua nɛ jɔ kaa nyɛ hu nyɛ ngɛ Kristo amanehlu ɔ eko nae, konɛ nyɛ na bua jɔmi babauu ngɛ e bami ligbi ɔ nɔ, be mi nɛ a ma je e anunyami ɔ kpo ɔ.<verse eid="1PE 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />A gbaa nyɛ, ke Kristo he je nɛ a jɛɔ nyɛ ngɛ. E ji jɔɔmi kɛ ha nyɛ, ejakaa Mawu anunyami mumi ɔ ngɛ nyɛ nɔ. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Nyɛ ti nɔ ko nɛ ko na amanehlu kaa nɔ gbelɔ loo julɔ loo yayami peelɔ loo nɔ ko nɛ e kɛ e he woɔ ni kpahi a sane mi. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Se ke nɔ ko ngɛ nɔ́ nae kaa Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ ɔ, e ko pee lɛ zo, se mohu e je Mawu yi. <verse eid="1PE 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Ejakaa be nɛ a maa je kojomi ɔ sisi ɔ e su ta, nɛ a kɛ maa je Mawu bi ɔmɛ a nɔ. Nɛ ke a kɛ wɔ je sisi kekle ɔ, ni nɛmɛ nɛ bui Manye Munyu ɔ tue ɔ, kɛ a nyagbe maa ba kɛɛ? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ Ngmami ɔ de ɔ, “Ke dalɔ yi wami hemi maa wa a, lɛɛ jije yayami peelɔ maa da?”<verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ naa amanehlu ngɛ Mawu suɔmi nya ni peemi mi ɔ, e ya nɔ nɛ e pee kpakpa a, nɛ e to e klaa a kɛ wo bɔlɔ anɔkualetsɛ ɔ dɛ mi.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s1">Nikɔtɔma amɛ a ga womi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Jehanɛ ɔ, ami nɛ ji asafo nɔkɔtɔma kaa nyɛ, nɛ i yeɔ Kristo amanehlu ɔmɛ a he odase, nɛ i ma na e anunyami ɔ nɛ a ma je kpo ngɛ e bami ligbi ɔ nɔ ɔ, i ngɛ nyɛ dee ke, <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />nyɛɛ le Mawu asafo nɛ nyɛ ngɛ nɔ hyɛe ɔ ngɛ suɔmi nya, pi ngɛ nɔ nɔ nyɛmi nya, loo se nami ko he, se mohu ngɛ tsui mi jɔmi nya. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Jehanɛ ɔ hu, nyɛ ko ye a nɔ matsɛ; se mohu nyɛɛ pee nyɛ he nɔ hyɛmi nɔ́ ko ha mɛ, <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />konɛ ke Nutsɔ ɔ ba a, nyɛ nine nɛ su e anunyami ɔ nɔ kɛ ya neneene.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Ja a nɔuu nyɛ jokuɛwi ɔmɛ hu, nyɛɛ ba nyɛ he si kɛ ha nikɔtɔma amɛ. Nyɛ tsuo nyɛ sɔmɔ nyɛ si bi kɛ he si bami subai, ejakaa Mawu kuɔ he woli a nya nɛ e gbaa he si bali. <verse eid="1PE 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛɛ ba nyɛ he si ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi, konɛ e wo nyɛ nɔ ngɛ e be nɛ sa mi.<verse eid="1PE 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Nyɛɛ ngɔ nyɛ haomi ɔmɛ tsuo ngɔ fɔ e nɔ, ejakaa e susuɔ nyɛ he.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Nyɛ hɛ nɛ ka si, nɛ nyɛ hɛ nɛ hi nyɛ he nɔ, ejakaa nyɛ he nyɛlɔ nɛ ji Abosiami ɔ, e ngɛ si kpae nɛ e ngɛ ngmlaa kpae kaa jata nɛ ngɛ nɔ hlae nɛ e ye. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Nyɛɛ da si kpɛii ngɛ nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi ɔ mi nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ lɛ nɛ kpe. Nyɛɛ le kaa amanehlu nɛ ɔmɛ nɔuu nyɛ nyɛmi ɔmɛ hu ngɛ nae ngɛ je ɔ mi tsuo.<verse eid="1PE 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Se ke nyɛ na amanehlu be bɔɔ se ɔ, Mawu nɛ ji dloomihi kulaa Tsɛ ɔ, nɔ nɛ tsɛ nyɛ kɛ ba e neneene anunyami mi ngɛ Kristo mi ɔ, lɛ nitsɛ e maa to nyɛ si ekohu nɛ e maa wo nyɛ he wami kɛ pi si. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Lɛ e ngɛ matsɛ yee kɛ yaa neneene. Amen.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />I ngma nyɛ womi kpiti nɛ ɔ kɛ gu nyɛmi Silvano nɔ, nɔ nɛ ji anɔkualetsɛ, kaa bɔ nɛ i buu lɛ ɔ, kɛ ngɛ nyɛ he wami woe, nɛ i ngɛ odase yee kaa enɛ ɔ ji Mawu anɔkuale dloomi ɔ nɛ. Nyɛɛ pɛtɛ he kpɛii.<verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Babilon asafo ɔ nɛ ji nyɛ nyɛmimɛ ɔ, kɛ ye bi Marko ngɛ Kristo mi ɔ ke a biɔ nyɛ. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Nyɛɛ kɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli a suɔmi nɛ nga nyɛ si bi. Nyɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli kulaa, nyɛ he manye!<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>